target/
# The archived split-debug artifacts (§3, §9). Outside target/ so `cargo clean`
# cannot delete the only copy a released tag symbolizes against; out of git
# because a PDB is megabytes and §9's fresh-clone bar is a budget.
dist-symbols/
# The scheduled tiers' ledger and transcripts (§5, §6 M90). Outside target/ for
# the same reason and one more: the scheduler's redirect names this directory
# and `cmd.exe` will not create it, so a `cargo clean` used to switch the
# schedule off rather than merely forget what it had done.
ci-status/
*.jsonl
*.md
!README.md
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
# The CVar config file (§4.8) is one machine's knobs, never the repo's.
gg.cfg
*.actual.txt
# Demo 14's sources (§6 M59). Fifty-one megabytes of glTF that `cargo xtask
# sponza` fetches from Khronos — demo 06's header refused to check Sponza in at
# §6 M11 and this is the same refusal, with the download written down.
demos/14-sponza/assets/
